  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Lemoned</h1>\n<p>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flemoned-(farmers-delight)\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">一款簡單的模組，為 Minecraft 加入了檸檬，並與 Farmer's Delight 相容！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/801/597/2024-02-03_14.png\" alt=\"Intro\" width=\"679\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">尋找檸檬農場或流浪商人，獲得檸檬種子，然後收穫你的檸檬吧。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">同時還新增了檸檬槍！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">（這是我的第一個非 MCreator 模組，所以可能會有一些小問題）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftejty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/988472/description_99901395-cdae-402c-9e91-7f8b27c59a9d.png\" alt=\"Support me on Ko-fi\" width=\"360\" height=\"48\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftejty%252fcommissions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/988472/description_0fed605d-2021-42e5-8e2a-15e812535fe6.png\" alt=\"Order custom mod\" width=\"360\" height=\"48\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/xByznP7RHw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/988472/description_ab810526-bb00-4248-9150-47c044ec2d87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"48\"></a></p>",
